# Ship policy (push only when asked)

**Do not `git push`** unless the user explicitly asks in that message.

Pushing a user-facing release is incomplete without a **version bump + `v*` git tag** — follow `sdk-cli-release-tags.mdc`.

If unclear: **commit only**, ask before any push.
